<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102205" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τακτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάσσω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ordered, prescribed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τακτόν τι παρὰ τοῦ Κύρου παραγγέλλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					8.3.28
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ἀργύριον</span> a
			<i>fixed</i> or <i>stated</i> sum, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.65
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. χρήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					746a
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῖτος τ</span>. <i>a fixed
				quantity of</i> corn, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. τροφὴν λαμβάνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					909c
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				141.6
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκαι τ</span>. <i>fixed</i>
			penalties, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				632b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκφόριον τ</span>. a
			<i>fixed</i> rent, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				3p.250
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ὁδός</span> a
				<i>prescribed</i> way, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				23.72
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τ. ἡμέραις βουλεύεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					2.109
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὰ τ. ἔτη πέντε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					101.10
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατά τινας χρόνους
			τ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				599b4
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τακτῶς</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				3.1.2
			</span></i>.</div>
